# Tracking Timeline Alignment Rule (@tracking-timeline-alignment.mdc)

## Objective
Ensure timeline items are consistently aligned without overlap by using a two-column grid: a fixed-width icon rail and a flexible content column.

---

## Pattern
- Layout: `grid grid-cols-[28px_1fr] gap-3`
- Icon rail (col 1):
  - Circle: `w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-gray-200 grid place-items-center`
  - Connector line below (except last item): `flex-1 w-px bg-gray-200 mt-2`
- Content (col 2):
  - Title row with status badge
  - Meta row: timestamp • location
  - Optional details and attachments
- No absolute positioning; avoid overlap on small screens.

---

## IDs & Naming
- Container: `parcego-tracking-timeline`
- Item: `parcego-tracking-timeline-item-{uuid}`
- Attachments: `parcego-tracking-attachment-{eventId}`

---

## Accessibility
- Icons must be decorative; context is conveyed via title/status text.
- Use semantic list: `<ol>` with `<li>` items.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

---

## Icons
- Must follow `lucide-kebab-case-icon-structure.mdc`: `<span class="iconify lucide-icon" data-icon="lucide:*" style="..." />`

---

## Example (JSX)
```jsx
<ol id="parcego-tracking-timeline" className="space-y-6">
  <li id="parcego-tracking-timeline-item-evt-1" className="grid grid-cols-[28px_1fr] gap-3">
    <div className="flex flex-col items-center">
      <div className="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white border border-gray-200 grid place-items-center">
        {React.createElement('span', { className: 'iconify lucide-icon', 'data-icon': 'lucide:truck', style: { width: '16px', height: '16px' } })}
      </div>
      <div className="flex-1 w-px bg-gray-200 mt-2" aria-hidden="true" />
    </div>
    <div className="flex flex-col gap-1">
      <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span className="font-medium text-gray-900">Out for delivery</span>
        <span className="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">OutForDelivery</span>
      </div>
      <span className="text-xs text-gray-500">2025-08-07 10:00 • Destination City</span>
      <p className="text-sm text-gray-700">Courier has the package</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ol>
```

---

## Enforcement
- Use this pattern for all timelines to prevent misalignment and overlapping content.
- No `position: absolute` for timeline icons.

